{"id":"sensors-conf-convert.8","n":"sensors-conf-convert","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"lm_sensors","ver":"3.6.0-10.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/l/lm_sensors-3.6.0-10.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/sensors-conf-convert.8.gz","sha256":"af7cc35aec437b5a31358196c52e232b7f31397160c420136d030815b7f9efc0","date":"August 2013","origin":"lm-sensors 3"},"u":{"pkg":"lm-sensors","ver":"1:3.6.0-7ubuntu1","repo":"jammy/universe","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/universe/l/lm-sensors/lm-sensors_3.6.0-7ubuntu1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/sensors-conf-convert.8.gz","sha256":"1c8eed9596195cb8712b78e80dd6817084cdb11b1b3103b79a01c36bbb27cf89","date":"August 2013","origin":"lm-sensors 3"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"sensors configuration conversion","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>sensors-conf-convert - sensors configuration conversion</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>sensors-conf-convert</b> &lt; <i>/etc/sensors.conf</i> &gt; <i>/etc/sensors3.conf</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>The purpose of the <b>sensors-conf-convert</b> tool is to convert <i>sensors.conf</i> from the lm_sensors version 2 format to the lm_sensors version 3 format.</p> <p>The old configuration file is read from the standard input and the new one is written to the standard output.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>sensors(1), libsensors(3)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Jean Delvare</p>"]]}